                    insight_truefair:       `True and fair view: you reached the judgement that fairly presents the substance of the Adler transaction and the receivable, disclosed the consequences, and answered the auditor on the standards. The accounting drove the number — not the covenant, not the €3.8M bonus.`,
                    insight_defensible:     `Defensible judgement: your positions are standards-grounded and disclosed, even if the composite hasn't fully landed. The audit committee can stand behind the numbers as a faithful representation.`,
                    insight_short:          `The statements fall short of a true and fair view. On this evidence the auditor may move toward a qualified opinion — re-examine which judgement bent toward the covenant or the bonus rather than the standards.`,
